      {
        "id": 544443817,
        "iid": 4017,
        "project_id": 34675721,
        "title": "fix(duo): keep missing binary versions empty",
        "description": "## Description\n\nKeep `InstallStatus.Version` limited to recorded version data rather than the display text `unknown version`. For custom Duo binaries without a recorded version, help displays the installed path without a version suffix. Recorded versions retain the existing version-and-path display.\n\nAdd regression coverage for custom and managed binaries with and without recorded versions, including the setup guidance for a managed binary without a recorded version.\n\n## Related Issues\n\nResolves #8550\n\n## How has this been tested?\n\n- Binary manager, Duo and Orbit package tests passed.\n- Required Lefthook pre-commit and pre-push checks passed: build, lint with zero issues, 418 tests, structural checks, and generated documentation/code without drift.\n- Tested on macOS arm64 with Go 1.27.1.\n\nAI assistance was used to prepare the change. The code received independent review and local testing.\n\n\\/copy_metadata #8550",
